    ("When can I enroll in or change my Medicare plan in South Carolina?", "Your Initial Enrollment Period is the seven months around your 65th birthday. The Annual Election Period runs October 15 to December 7; Medicare Advantage Open Enrollment runs January 1 to March 31. Moving, losing a plan, qualifying for Medicaid, or a FEMA disaster declaration opens a Special Enrollment Period."),
